From fd83271e217d87f45720b4842e7451d2f7ea3d83 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Corvid <corvid@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 11:24:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Corvid v1.6: FFmpeg 9

- Accept FFmpeg 7, 8 and 9 (compatibility check and every source).
- The mp3, opus, vorbis and AudioToolbox AAC encoders no longer add the
  global "-vsync drop" for FFmpeg 7 and later (the option is gone there,
  the process would not start). FFmpeg 6 gets the same command as before.
- opus: the delay option was passed without its dash.
- Version 1.6.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UhjysExATCKDyVfUWLA89B
